<title>USA: Camden, Paragon approve merger.</title>
<headline>Camden, Paragon approve merger.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Camden Property Trust and Paragon Group Inc said their shareholders on Tuesday approved the merger of the two companies.</p>
<p>Both companies said about 98 percent of the shares that were voted approved the merger.</p>
<p>The companies said approvals required a majority of Camden's shares voting at the meeting and two-thirds of Paragon's shares outstanding be voted in favor of the combination.</p>
<p>The companies said the mergers were scheduled to be effective Wednesday, at which time Paragon shareholders were to receive 0.64 shares of Camden common stock for each share of Paragon common shock.</p>
</text>
